<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>SFR Steels | Scrap Importers - Sourcing Metal Scrap Worldwide</title>
<meta name="description" content="SFR Steels imports HMS 1&2, shredded scrap, used rails, turnings and cast iron scrap from suppliers in every country.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;700;800&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bone:#f2ede3; --paper:#fbf8f1; --ink:#12100e; --orange:#ff5722; --yellow:#ffd23f; --grey:#6b665e;
    --display:'Anton',Impact,'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;
    --mono:'Space Mono',ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{font-family:'Manrope','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bone);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;overflow-x:hidden}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  .wrap{width:min(1240px,92%);margin:auto}
  section{padding:110px 0;position:relative}
  .mono{font-family:var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:.78rem}
  .label{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--ink);color:var(--yellow);padding:6px 14px;margin-bottom:22px}
  h2.big{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6.5vw,5.4rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:.5px}
  .hl{background:var(--yellow);padding:0 .15em;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone}
  .out{color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:2px var(--ink)}
  .or{color:var(--orange)}

  /* TICKER */
  .ticker{background:var(--ink);color:var(--yellow);overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:3px solid var(--orange)}
  .ticker .tr{display:inline-flex;gap:46px;animation:tick 38s linear infinite;padding-left:46px}
  .ticker span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .ticker span::before{content:"★";color:var(--orange);margin-right:14px}
  @keyframes tick{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

  /* HEADER */
  header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:var(--bone);border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink)}
  .nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;height:76px}
  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.7rem;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .logo b{background:var(--ink);color:var(--yellow);padding:2px 10px;font-weight:400;transform:rotate(-3deg)}
  nav ul{display:flex;gap:6px;list-style:none}
  nav a{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.78rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:9px 14px;border:2px solid transparent;transition:.15s;display:block}
  nav a:hover{border-color:var(--ink);background:var(--yellow)}
  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bone);font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:.85rem;padding:16px 28px;border:2px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--orange);cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}
  .btn:hover{transform:translate(4px,4px);box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--orange)}
  .btn.alt{background:var(--orange);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--ink)}
  .btn.alt:hover{box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--ink)}
  .btn.sm{padding:11px 20px;font-size:.75rem;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--orange)}
  .menu-btn{display:none;background:var(--ink);color:var(--yellow);border:none;font-size:1.4rem;padding:6px 12px;cursor:pointer}

  /* HERO */
  .hero{padding:70px 0 100px;overflow:hidden;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(18,16,14,.06) 0 1px,transparent 1px 44px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(18,16,14,.06) 0 1px,transparent 1px 44px),var(--bone)}
  .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}
  .hero h1{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(3.2rem,9vw,8rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:28px}
  .hero p{max-width:520px;font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:34px;font-weight:500}
  .hero .btns{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .stack{position:relative;height:560px}
  .ph{position:absolute;background:var(--paper);padding:10px 10px 38px;border:2px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:10px 10px 0 var(--ink);transition:.4s}
  .ph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;border:2px solid var(--ink)}
  .ph em{position:absolute;bottom:9px;left:12px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.68rem;font-style:normal;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
  .ph.a{width:64%;height:62%;left:0;top:6%;transform:rotate(-5deg);z-index:1}
  .ph.b{width:58%;height:48%;right:0;top:0;transform:rotate(6deg);z-index:2}
  .ph.c{width:62%;height:46%;right:6%;bottom:0;transform:rotate(-2deg);z-index:3}
  .stack:hover .ph.a{transform:rotate(-8deg) translate(-8px,-6px)}
  .stack:hover .ph.b{transform:rotate(9deg) translate(10px,-8px)}
  .stack:hover .ph.c{transform:rotate(1deg) translate(6px,8px)}
  .sticker{position:absolute;left:-24px;bottom:30px;width:150px;height:150px;z-index:6;background:var(--yellow);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--ink);display:grid;place-items:center}
  .sticker svg{position:absolute;inset:4px;width:calc(100% - 8px);height:calc(100% - 8px);animation:spin 16s linear infinite}
  .sticker span{font-family:var(--display);font-size:2rem;color:var(--orange);position:relative}
  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}

  /* STATS */
  .stats{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bone);padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid var(--orange)}
  .stats .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
  .stat{padding:44px 26px;border-right:1px solid rgba(242,237,227,.15)}
  .stat:last-child{border:none}
  .stat h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.4rem);line-height:1;color:var(--yellow)}
  .stat p{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.74rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:#b9b2a5;margin-top:6px}

  /* ABOUT */
  .about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.95fr 1.05fr;gap:70px;align-items:center}
  .about-photo{position:relative}
  .about-photo img{width:100%;height:560px;object-fit:cover;border:2px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:14px 14px 0 var(--orange);display:block}
  .tape{position:absolute;top:-16px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-3deg);background:var(--yellow);border:2px solid var(--ink);padding:6px 22px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:700}
  .about p.lead{font-size:1.12rem;margin:24px 0 30px;color:#2a2622}
  .feat{display:grid;gap:0;border-top:2px solid var(--ink)}
  .feat div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:70px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);align-items:center;transition:.2s}
  .feat div:hover{padding-left:14px;background:var(--yellow)}
  .feat b{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:2rem;color:var(--orange)}
  .feat span{font-weight:700}

  /* GRADES (bento) */
  #grades{background:var(--paper);border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink)}
  .head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:50px}
  .head p{max-width:380px;color:var(--grey)}
  .bento{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);grid-auto-rows:250px;gap:18px}
  .tile{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:2px solid var(--ink);background:#222 center/cover no-repeat;color:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:22px;transition:.3s;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--ink)}
  .tile::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(18,16,14,.92),rgba(18,16,14,.1) 65%);transition:.3s}
  .tile:hover{transform:translate(-4px,-4px);box-shadow:10px 10px 0 var(--orange)}
  .tile:hover::before{background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,87,34,.92),rgba(18,16,14,.15) 75%)}
  .tile>*{position:relative}
  .tile .n{position:absolute;top:16px;left:18px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.78rem;background:var(--yellow);color:var(--ink);padding:3px 10px;font-weight:700}
  .tile h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:1.9rem;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1}
  .tile p{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:8px;color:#ffd9c9}
  .tile.big{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}
  .tile.big h3{font-size:3.2rem}
  .tile.wide{grid-column:span 2}
  .t1{background-image:url('images/scrap-1.png')}
  .t2{background-image:url('images/scrap-3.png');background-position:80% 40%}
  .t3{background-image:url('images/scrap-2.png');background-position:20% 85%}
  .t4{background-image:url('images/scrap-3.png');background-position:30% 90%}
  .t5{background-image:url('images/scrap-2.png');background-position:60% 30%}

  /* ORIGINS */
  .rows{border-top:3px solid var(--ink);margin-top:10px}
  .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.4fr 60px;gap:20px;align-items:center;padding:30px 0;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);transition:.25s;cursor:default}
  .row h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3.6rem);text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1}
  .row p{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.82rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--grey);transition:.25s}
  .row i{font-style:normal;font-size:2rem;justify-self:end;transition:.25s}
  .row:hover{background:var(--orange);padding-left:26px;padding-right:20px}
  .row:hover p{color:var(--ink)}
  .row:hover i{transform:rotate(-45deg)}

  /* PROCESS */
  #process{background:var(--orange);border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink)}
  .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:50px;position:relative}
  .steps::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:5%;right:5%;top:46px;border-top:4px dashed var(--ink);z-index:0}
  .step{position:relative;z-index:1;background:var(--bone);border:2px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--ink);padding:24px 20px;transition:.2s}
  .step:hover{transform:translateY(-8px)}
  .step .ic{width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--yellow);border:2px solid var(--ink);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.7rem;margin-bottom:16px}
  .step small{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;color:var(--orange);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px}
  .step h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:1.6rem;text-transform:uppercase;margin:2px 0 6px}
  .step p{font-size:.88rem;color:#3a352f}

  /* CONTACT */
  #contact{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bone)}
  #contact .label{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--ink)}
  .c-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:70px;align-items:start}
  #contact h2.big .out{-webkit-text-stroke:2px var(--bone)}
  .info{margin-top:34px;display:grid;gap:20px}
  .info div{border-left:4px solid var(--orange);padding-left:16px}
  .info small{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--yellow);font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px}
  .info span{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700}
  form{background:var(--bone);color:var(--ink);padding:34px;border:2px solid var(--bone);box-shadow:12px 12px 0 var(--orange);display:grid;gap:14px}
  .toggle{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border:2px solid var(--ink)}
  .toggle label{cursor:pointer}
  .toggle input{display:none}
  .toggle span{display:block;text-align:center;padding:14px 8px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;transition:.2s}
  .toggle input:checked+span{background:var(--ink);color:var(--yellow)}
  input[type=text],input[type=email],input[type=tel],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:15px 16px;background:var(--paper);border:2px solid var(--ink);color:var(--ink);font-size:.98rem;font-family:inherit;border-radius:0;transition:.15s}
  input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:none;background:#fff6cf;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--orange)}
  .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
  #msg{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--orange);font-weight:700}

  footer{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bone);border-top:2px solid rgba(242,237,227,.2);padding:40px 0 26px;overflow:hidden}
  footer .mega{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(4rem,17vw,15rem);line-height:.85;text-transform:uppercase;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:2px rgba(242,237,227,.35);white-space:nowrap;text-align:center}
  footer .bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:24px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.74rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#b9b2a5}
  .wa{position:fixed;right:22px;bottom:22px;z-index:60;width:60px;height:60px;background:#25d366;border:2px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--ink);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.6rem;transition:.15s}
  .wa:hover{transform:translate(3px,3px);box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--ink)}

  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px);transition:opacity .8s,transform .8s}
  .reveal.show{opacity:1;transform:none}

  @media(max-width:980px){
    .menu-btn{display:block}
    nav{position:absolute;top:76px;left:0;width:100%;background:var(--bone);border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);display:none}
    nav.open{display:block}
    nav ul{flex-direction:column;padding:16px 4%}
    .nav>.btn{display:none}
    .hero-grid,.about,.c-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .stack{height:470px;max-width:520px;margin:20px auto 0}
    .sticker{left:0;width:120px;height:120px}
    .stats .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .stat:nth-child(2){border-right:none}
    .stat{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(242,237,227,.15)}
    .about-photo img{height:380px}
    .bento{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-auto-rows:220px}
    .tile.big{grid-column:span 2}
    .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .steps::before{display:none}
    .row{grid-template-columns:1fr 40px}
    .row p{grid-column:1/2;grid-row:2}
    section{padding:76px 0}
  }
  @media(max-width:560px){
    .bento{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .tile.big,.tile.wide{grid-column:span 1}
    .tile.big{grid-row:span 1}
    .tile.big h3{font-size:2.2rem}
    .steps,.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    form{padding:22px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="ticker"><div class="tr" id="tick"></div></div>

<header>
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <a href="#home" class="logo"><b>SFR</b>STEELS</a>
    <nav id="nav">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#grades">Grades</a></li>
        <li><a href="#origins">Origins</a></li>
        <li><a href="#process">Process</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn sm">Get a Quote →</a>
    <button class="menu-btn" onclick="document.getElementById('nav').classList.toggle('open')">☰</button>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Scrap Importers · Est. Worldwide Sourcing</span>
      <h1>We <span class="hl">Import</span> Scrap From <span class="out">Every</span> <span class="or">Corner</span> Of The World.</h1>
      <p>SFR Steels buys and imports graded ferrous scrap (HMS 1&amp;2, shredded, rails, turnings, cast iron) from suppliers in every country and delivers it to mills and foundries.</p>
      <div class="btns">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn alt">Send Requirement →</a>
        <a href="#grades" class="btn">See Scrap Grades</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stack">
      <div class="ph a"><img src="images/scrap-1.png" alt="HMS scrap pile"><em>Fig.01 · HMS 1&amp;2</em></div>
      <div class="ph b"><img src="images/scrap-2.png" alt="Grapple loading scrap"><em>Fig.02 · Loading</em></div>
      <div class="ph c"><img src="images/scrap-3.png" alt="Scrap yard handler"><em>Fig.03 · Port yard</em></div>
      <div class="sticker">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200"><defs><path id="circ" d="M100,100 m-76,0 a76,76 0 1,1 152,0 a76,76 0 1,1 -152,0"/></defs>
          <text font-family="Space Mono" font-weight="700" font-size="14" fill="#12100e"><textPath href="#circ" textLength="470" lengthAdjust="spacing">IMPORTING SCRAP WORLDWIDE ★ SFR STEELS ★ </textPath></text></svg>
        <span>↘</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STATS -->
<div class="stats">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="stat"><h3 data-count="50000" data-suf="+">0</h3><p>MT imported yearly</p></div>
    <div class="stat"><h3 data-count="60" data-suf="+">0</h3><p>Origin countries</p></div>
    <div class="stat"><h3 data-count="500" data-suf="+">0</h3><p>Shipments received</p></div>
    <div class="stat"><h3 data-count="100" data-suf="%">0</h3><p>Material inspected</p></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <div class="about-photo reveal">
      <span class="tape">Port &amp; yard operations</span>
      <img src="images/scrap-3.png" alt="Scrap handling at port">
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="label">About Us</span>
      <h2 class="big">Scrap In. <span class="hl">Steel</span> Out. <span class="out">No Drama.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">We are scrap importers. We find reliable overseas suppliers, inspect the material, arrange shipping and customs, and deliver consistent quality to steel mills and foundries on schedule.</p>
      <div class="feat">
        <div><b>01</b><span>Direct relationships with overseas scrap suppliers</span></div>
        <div><b>02</b><span>Pre-shipment inspection of quality and quantity</span></div>
        <div><b>03</b><span>Bulk vessel and container imports, CIF / CFR terms</span></div>
        <div><b>04</b><span>Customs clearance and complete documentation</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- GRADES -->
<section id="grades">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head reveal">
      <div><span class="label">What We Import</span><h2 class="big">Scrap <span class="or">Grades</span></h2></div>
      <p>Graded to ISRI and international specifications, supplied in bulk or containers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bento">
      <div class="tile big t1 reveal"><span class="n">01</span><h3>HMS 1 &amp; 2 (80:20)</h3><p>Heavy melting steel · 3mm+ · Bulk shipment</p></div>
      <div class="tile t2 reveal"><span class="n">02</span><h3>Shredded</h3><p>Density 0.9+ MT/m³</p></div>
      <div class="tile t3 reveal"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Used Rails</h3><p>R50 / R65 · 1-3 m cuts</p></div>
      <div class="tile wide t4 reveal"><span class="n">04</span><h3>Steel Turnings</h3><p>Clean, oil-free machine turnings and borings</p></div>
      <div class="tile wide t5 reveal"><span class="n">05</span><h3>Cast Iron Scrap</h3><p>Engine blocks, machinery castings · under 500mm</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ORIGINS -->
<section id="origins">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head reveal">
      <div><span class="label">Sourcing Network</span><h2 class="big">We Source From <span class="hl">All Countries</span></h2></div>
      <p>Tell us the grade and the port. We find the supplier.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rows reveal">
      <div class="row"><h3>Middle East</h3><p>UAE · Saudi Arabia · Oman · Qatar · Kuwait · Bahrain</p><i>→</i></div>
      <div class="row"><h3>Europe</h3><p>UK · Spain · Italy · Greece · Netherlands · Germany</p><i>→</i></div>
      <div class="row"><h3>Americas</h3><p>USA · Canada · Mexico · Brazil · Chile</p><i>→</i></div>
      <div class="row"><h3>Africa</h3><p>South Africa · Egypt · Nigeria · Kenya · Algeria</p><i>→</i></div>
      <div class="row"><h3>Asia-Pacific</h3><p>Australia · Singapore · Malaysia · Thailand · Japan</p><i>→</i></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROCESS -->
<section id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal"><span class="label">How We Work</span><h2 class="big">From Overseas Yard <span class="out" style="-webkit-text-stroke-color:var(--ink)">To Your Gate</span></h2></div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="ic">🌍</div><small>STEP 01</small><h3>Source</h3><p>We locate and negotiate with verified suppliers.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="ic">🔍</div><small>STEP 02</small><h3>Inspect</h3><p>Quality and quantity checked before loading.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="ic">🚢</div><small>STEP 03</small><h3>Ship</h3><p>Bulk vessel or container with full tracking.</p></div>
